                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontname='Tableau Regular'>Note: Segment, Functional Area, Department and F/L filters are only relevant for SG and regional -based entities.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontname='Tableau Regular'>Gender and Foreign / Local data are only applicable for APAC, Woowa, &amp; SG, and for Employee types only. </run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontname='Tableau Regular'>APAC, Woowa, SG, MY, JP data is accurate as of 1/1/2020. MYSSC, HK, PH, PK, TH, TW data is accurate as of 1/1/2021. </run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontname='Tableau Regular'>Attrition Headers exclude Foodpanda Japan, Stores and Malaysia SSC</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontname='Tableau Regular'>Annual Attrition by Entity: 2022 is annualized,  ((</run>
                  <run fontname='Slack-Lato,Slack-Fractions,appleLogo,sans-serif' fontsize='8'>SUM([Leavers])/ ((SUM([End Yearheadcount])+SUM([Beg Yearheadcount]))/2))/ Current Month of Year) *12</run>
